# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Files in this list are NOT uploaded to Cloudflare on `wrangler deploy`.
# Syntax follows .gitignore.  Only the deployed Chinese index.html
# (and the assets it references) should ship to the edge.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Alternate language / backup builds (dev only) ---
index-en.html
index-zh.html

# --- Internal design system & docs ---
orka-components.html
orka-tokens.css
design-system.md
tokens.json
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.md

# --- Redundant PNG sources (WebP equivalents already referenced) ---
bg-listen.png
bg-remote.png
img-mode-icon-source.png
启动页背景图.png
产品图.png
# NOTE: `orka hearing aids.png` (314 KB) IS referenced by index.html at the
# Bluetooth pairing screen. It is NOT excluded here. Converting it to .webp
# would cut ~300 KB off page weight — recommended follow-up.

# --- English-only image aliases (only used by index-en.html) ---
product.png
product.webp
splash-bg.png
splash-bg.webp

# --- Unused SVG sources (icons are inlined into index.html) ---
嘈杂.svg
对话.svg
通用.svg
亲友代调icon.svg

# --- Deploy-time config (not served as static asset) ---
wrangler.toml
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.json
.assetsignore

# --- System / tooling / build cache ---
.DS_Store
.wrangler/
.git/
node_modules/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.log
